# Reproduced on BOTH the ticket build (eb6561bad) and a control build of base d14bba041 (same device, same backend :8146 DB multi_food_db_qa3846)
Summary a11y (both builds): 'Subtotal 28.25' / 'Delivery Fee + -1.00 AED' / no VAT line / 'Total Amount'' AED' (no digits) / 'Place Order' click=false
